OL,3,GNEWSAThird stoat killed and hunt for a
OL,4,Afourth on Orkney island
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third stoat has been trapped and
OL,7,Fkilled on Rousay in Orkney, while
OL,8,Fefforts are ongoing to catch a fourth
OL,9,Fafter it was spotted on camera.
OL,11,FThe mammals are not native to Orkney
OL,12,Fand prey on ground-nesting birds as
OL,13,Fwell as a subspecies of vole that is
OL,14,Fnot found anywhere else in the world.
OL,16,FThe first-ever stoat on the island was
OL,17,Fcaught on 9 October near Loch of
OL,18,FLoomachun as part of a #15m project to
OL,19,Feradicate the predator from the
OL,20,Farchipelago.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
